@startuml
title Dee on two devices: general on her laptop, the kitchen on her phone
actor "Dee's laptop (in general)" as laptop
actor "Dee's phone" as phone
participant "Chat" as app
actor "Ada, Bob (have room:general open)" as general
actor "Eve (has room:kitchen open)" as kitchen

phone -> app : connect
app --> phone : open session
phone -> app : replace session /name "Dee"
note right of app : a demo: entering "Dee" makes this session Dee
app --> phone : patch session replace /name "Dee"
app --> phone : open lobby
phone -> app : replace session /room "kitchen"
app --> phone : patch session replace /room "kitchen"
group derived again: a patch goes only where a value changed
  app -> kitchen : patch room:kitchen add /members/Dee
  note over general : general does not change: Dee is still there, on her laptop
end
app --> phone : open room:kitchen
note over laptop : the laptop's session is its own: still in general
@enduml
